\", \"q\": \"CDC limited this analysis to 174 (33.3%) laboratories in 42 states that met the following criteria\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For consistency, only results of antigen detection methods are included in the analysis.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}